{"id":"661357","name":"油炸花生米","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661357/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花生米","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白酒","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"底油加至温的。","img":"images/661357/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入花生米。","img":"images/661357/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小火慢慢炒。","img":"images/661357/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"勤翻炒。","img":"images/661357/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"间隔七八秒就翻翻。","img":"images/661357/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"重复七八秒翻翻的动作，能感受到花生米上色了。","img":"images/661357/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一定最小火，慢慢炒，用油的温度去喂熟花生米。","img":"images/661357/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"五分钟后，颜色越来越深，快好了，这个时候勤搅拌。","img":"images/661357/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"滴一瓶盖白酒，让花生米更脆。","img":"images/661357/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661357/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒点盐粒，冷却20分钟，就脆了，上桌。","img":"images/661357/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}